{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b308b52f0e08e3e88a3175c46b12f72864b8c1e8e317007b622274cddbf2fa2b", "ja": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』の対決が続いている。\nみんな、悔いのないよう頑張ってほしいが…）", "zh": "（《BATTLE OF THEATER》的对决仍在继续。希望大家都能努力拼搏，不留下遗憾，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "2d941b4e119e72b7de6f195db5eec9b39c92865d5f3e986914257e4f223f6ba5", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7b4d1a6f31eeb6dea132235fdc263652f8d0f38d9065add012defd504ecd43d8", "ja": "瑞希、お疲れさま。\nあれ？　今日は休みじゃなかったか？", "zh": "瑞希，辛苦了。\n咦？今天不是休息日吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "6c39991742a5ec6c17f61d1a1688b64bc213eaf69c0a57406768874fcf5a67c3", "ja": "はい。実は、忘れ物をしてしまいまして。", "zh": "是的。其实，我不小心忘了带东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "06f8cb107e384a8f4c60c881070049b2bb08dafe12915f794a1eb4e0a7ae1b5d", "ja": "恐らく、{$P$}の\nポケットの中に隠れていると思うのですが。", "zh": "我想，它恐怕是藏在{$P$}的\n口袋里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ec7cee9710956e8144b52671679195fb1f91cc4b71731ea23a697f2f9f18303c", "ja": "ポケット？　いや、俺のポケットなんて何も……\nえっ！？", "zh": "口袋？不，我的口袋里什么都没……\n诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "be4513d67b6090c67d6e0cf51464ea70ee4ba4a9351512fd7f5abf2d359af0bf", "ja": "じゃーん。\n……いかがでしょう。", "zh": "锵锵。\n……您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1007_p", "source_sha256": "37ae1e49055701fc327c86c26244fe61003922b328a2f906db9ae1732c65d6b6", "ja": "ぽ、ポケットから拳銃……のオモチャか。\nけど、いつの間に……！", "zh": "手、手枪从口袋里……原来是玩具啊。\n可是，她什么时候……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b458633174ec7b31f34746a0ac2dcf32bfe8bd723dd5f98ff914e657cfc8d19f", "ja": "瑞希の手品か……\n更に腕を上げたんだな。", "zh": "是瑞希的魔术吗……\n手法又进步了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "2ec561b182f0343e3c7c896840dea2e37a694128dc7ea77ed43ebcc9111e4853", "ja": "はい。CDを売るためには、少しでも多くのお客さんを\n引きつけなければと思いまして。……このように。", "zh": "是的。为了卖出CD，我想必须尽可能吸引更多客人……就像这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b4e94da167658c400b29a43e4bc756259a7fc010e593b2beaff3d87a374c999e", "ja": "今度は反対のポケットから、ナイフのオモチャが！\n……これなら確かに、人目を引けそうだ。", "zh": "这次又从另一边的口袋里掏出了一把玩具刀！\n……这样确实能吸引人们的注意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6db63d11ee2ab21389fc2b836e268cd834b099cf46ed9852b82f404dbb1efbca", "ja": "けど、アイテムのセレクトが\nちょっと物騒な気が……。", "zh": "不过，这个道具的选择，感觉有点危险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "8e48a3f276dd0c41c81d1dbeda16a37239b68947415686c2c3cf77a0e2d8004e", "ja": "はい。なので、最後にこちらを……どうぞ。", "zh": "是的。所以最后请收下这个……给您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0a41845a000cca57c9052535cf94cbe75befd7f36210f71824006345c0b0de87", "ja": "え？　白い粉の入った袋……！？", "zh": "诶？装着白色粉末的袋子……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b17b7e25a7005c185a1614bf1139ad4c833bb079d44f9af9abb92595cc3ffce", "ja": "あれ。すみません、\nスノーボールクッキーを入れたつもりだったのですが。", "zh": "哎呀。不好意思，\n我本来是打算放雪球饼干进去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0948f115acc3a28db9fad0880e8b95cfde6d8ce94b7d054a43f91cfb048a1f70", "ja": "そうか、仕込んだ後に割れちゃったんだな……。\nお菓子は、壊れにくい物のほうがいいかもしれない。", "zh": "这样啊，是在准备好之后裂开的吧……  \n甜点或许还是选不容易坏的比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8d2f4163ea2dfc07ee305104f4f11b954cc7c0cd03acf17442b3c0779d42da48", "ja": "けど、すごいな。\nお客さんもびっくりすると思う。", "zh": "不过，真厉害啊。客人们应该也会大吃一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "d72081968c7782838621d0c672515fb7151bbd7bcc7843de90f578f94d311ff0", "ja": "ありがとうございます。練習した甲斐がありました。\nお菓子の種類は、要検討ですが。", "zh": "谢谢。看来练习没有白费。\n不过，点心的种类还需要再考虑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0583_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "d21c43ec3afecde9fddbd64b75e67821835de82c83e503895b768748d0f43c68", "ja": "次のイベント、誰よりも注目されてみせます。\n……やるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "下次的活动，我一定会比任何人都受到瞩目。\n……加油，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
